{
  "//": [
    "MODELO - copie para .claude/settings.local.json (esse sim fica fora do git).",
    "Define qual navegador o Playwright MCP usa NA SUA MAQUINA.",
    "Mantenha apenas UM bloco 'env'. Reinicie o Claude Code (ou /mcp) apos alterar.",
    "Instale os navegadores uma vez:  npx playwright install firefox chrome msedge",
    "",
    "Google Chrome:",
    "  \"env\": {",
    "    \"PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER\": \"chrome\"",
    "  }",
    "",
    "Mozilla Firefox:",
    "  \"env\": {",
    "    \"PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER\": \"firefox\"",
    "  }",
    "",
    "Microsoft Edge:",
    "  \"env\": {",
    "    \"PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER\": \"msedge\"",
    "  }"
  ],
  "env": {
    "PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSER": "firefox"
  }
}
